or":"李道纯","text":"千经万论讲宗风，可叹迷途见不同。\n大辩高谈夸俊锐，到头终是落顽空。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33091,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏儒释道三教总赠程洁庵：道教十四首 其十二 不如守中","author":"李道纯","text":"说妙谈玄了不通，争如默默守其中。\n不偏不倚玄关透，不易方能合圣功。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33092,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏儒释道三教总赠程洁庵：道教十四首 其十三 九转神丹","author":"李道纯","text":"立鼎烧乾四大海，安炉炼碎五虚弥。\n金丹成象包三界，方是男儿得志时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33093,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏儒释道三教总赠程洁庵：道教十四首 其十四 可道非常道","author":"李道纯","text":"真常之道无言说，有说分明是背宗。\n若向不言中会意，不劳余力备全功。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33094,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题马虚中画","author":"黄溍","text":"人在白云处，舟在清溪曲。\n不闻欸乃声，但见山水绿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33095,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗五首 其一","author":"黄溍","text":"日月东西行，群动亦不息。\n寄身万物中，宁独谢兹役。\n所以鲁中叟，遑遑走南北。\n圣哲谅已然，旅人能久宅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33096,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗五首 其二","author":"黄溍","text":"晨起步南园，旭日朗以清。\n葵花众草中，晔晔敷丹荣。\n流光非汝私，独尔心自倾。\n览物有深怀，伫立方含情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33097,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗五首 其三","author":"黄溍","text":"璞玉与宝剑，沦落初未偶。\n君看被湔祓，各在千年后。\n将身比金石，谁当独长久。\n悠悠百代下，相知复何有。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33098,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗五首 其四","author":"黄溍","text":"孤云澹无心，出山偶为雨。\n长风忽吹散，渺渺归无处。\n唯馀向来山，突兀青如故。\n慷哉鲁仲连，功成身已去。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33099,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗五首 其五","author":"黄溍","text":"春风著万物，欣欣皆自私。\n可怜儿女花，荣悴更相持。\n独有涧底松，偃蹇如不知。\n何疑杨执戟，草玄鬓若丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33100,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"人事如草木","author":"黄溍","text":"人事如草木，一气荣悴之。\n外物何预人，而寘喜与悲。\n堂堂异姓王，昔者跨下儿。\n穷通本邂逅，达者固不疑。\n阮生亦隘人，恸哭真奚为。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33101,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"煌煌明月珠","author":"黄溍","text":"煌煌明月珠，未害居浊水。\n君看黄河黄，岂解污清济。\n我方遗吾形，宠辱齐一指。\n悬知破琴戴，未若掺挝祢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33102,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"微云翳白日","author":"黄溍","text":"微云翳白日，群动何喧喧。\n呜呼麒麟儿，化为猴与猿。\n登高望四荒，但见黄河奔。\n谁哉溯其流，与我归昆崙。\n萎蕤青桂花，霜霰日已繁。\n岂不有桃李，对之有忘言。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33103,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]